<title>NETHERLANDS: Rabo Securities says Elsevier undervalued.</title>
<headline>Rabo Securities says Elsevier undervalued.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of research note.</p>
<p>    Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker--------</p>
<p>    Elsevier	  Publishing    28.90   Rabo Securities</p>
<p>COMMENT: BUY (reiterated). Elsevier share price has lagged that of sector peers VNU and Wolters Kluwer. In terms of P/E and P/CF ratios Elsevier lies between VNU and Wolters. Elsevier deserves higher valution than VNU. Faster earnings growth justifies higher valuation for Wolters but difference in valuation vs Elsevier is too big.</p>
<p>    Estimates (NLG):   EPS	pvs	P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1996		   1.13     ---	25.6    0.72</p>
<p>    1997		   1.34     ---	21.6    0.77</p>
<p>    1998		   1.49     ---	19.4    0.82</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
